<!-- ══ COVER ══ -->
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy <span style="font-weight:400;color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;">· LF Academy</span></div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小五 · 第 5 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">AreaTrap專項突破</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">公式總複習 · SSPA高頻Trap · 綜合解題策略 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》5上A冊 ＋ 現代教育 5上A 單元1-4（綜合複習）<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>T4 多餘資訊 + T5 圖形錯覺 — 所有AreaTrap的綜合密集訓練<br/>
                       ÷2遺忘 · 單位換算坑 · 組合圖形分割錯 · 反求時運算倒置<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試Area題失分重災區，本堂針對性殲滅所有常見Trap<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>P4-P5 全部Area公式（正方/長方/Parallelogram/Triangle/Trapezoid）<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 三種形狀公式對比記憶 ❷ SSPA常見Trap逐一破解 ❸ 建立解題策略流程 ❹ 達到Trap零失誤
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ══ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ══ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）— 混合形狀快速判斷</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>Parallelogram底 9 cm，高 6 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Triangle底 12 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Trapezoid上底 5 cm，下底 9 cm，高 4 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>Rectangle長 11 cm，闊 6 cm。它的Area = ？Perimeter = ？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（注意：Area和Perimeter要分開寫！）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Square邊長 7 cm。Area = ？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（有人答 28 cm²— 錯在哪？）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Area公式總複習 — 三種形狀對比<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 以下三種形狀 <strong>底和高都相同</strong>時，Area關係是固定的<br/>
      ② 記憶Mnemonic：「平四完整乘，三角要一半，Trapezoid兩底和乘高再一半」<br/>
      ③ 單位必寫 cm² / m²，漏寫 ² 在呈分試中必定扣分
    </div>
</div>
<table class="cmp-table">
<tr><th>形狀</th><th>圖示</th><th>Area公式</th><th>關鍵Trap</th></tr>
<tr>
<td class="hl">Parallelogram</td>
<td>
<svg height="60" viewbox="0 0 120 60" width="120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="50" x="35" y="15"></rect><polyline fill="none" points="45,15 45,25 35,25" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polyline><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="60" y="53">l</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="21" y="25">w</text></svg>
</td>
<td style="font-weight:900;color:#1E40AF;">底 × 高</td>
<td style="font-size:10px;color:#DC2626;">高是垂直距離，不是斜邊</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="hl">Triangle</td>
<td>
<svg height="95" viewbox="0 0 120 95" width="120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,45 85,45 60,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="60" x2="60" y1="20" y2="45"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="72" y="33">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="60" y="67">b</text></svg>
</td>
<td style="font-weight:900;color:#166534;">底 × 高 <span style="color:#DC2626;">÷ 2</span></td>
<td style="font-size:10px;color:#DC2626;">最容易忘記÷2！</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="hl">Trapezoid</td>
<td>
<svg height="80" viewbox="0 0 110 80" width="110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,40 75,40 68,20 42,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="42" x2="42" y1="20" y2="40"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="54" y="30">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="55" y="62">b₂</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="54" y="12">b₁</text></svg>
</td>
<td style="font-weight:900;color:#92400E;">(上底+下底) × 高 <span style="color:#DC2626;">÷ 2</span></td>
<td style="font-size:10px;color:#DC2626;">忘÷2、用錯斜邊當高、上底下底取反</td>
</tr>
</table>
<div class="fig-row">
<div class="fig-card">
<div class="fig-title">同一底和高下，三個形狀的Area關係</div>
<div class="fig-row"><div class="fig-card"><div class="fig-title">Parallelogram</div><svg height="120" viewbox="0 0 210 120" width="210" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="140" x="35" y="15"></rect><polyline fill="none" points="45,15 45,25 35,25" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polyline><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="105" y="113">l</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="21" y="55">w</text></svg><div style="font-size:10px;color:#1E40AF;font-weight:700;">底x高 = 最大</div></div><div class="fig-card"><div class="fig-title">Triangle</div><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 210 150" width="210" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,100 175,100 105,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="105" x2="105" y1="20" y2="100"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="117" y="60">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="105" y="122">b</text></svg><div style="font-size:10px;color:#166534;font-weight:700;">底x高/2 = 一半</div></div><div class="fig-card"><div class="fig-title">Trapezoid</div><svg height="135" viewbox="0 0 210 135" width="210" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,95 175,95 145,20 65,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="65" x2="65" y1="20" y2="95"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="77" y="58">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="105" y="117">b₂</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="105" y="12">b₁</text></svg><div style="font-size:10px;color:#92400E;font-weight:700;">(a+b)xh/2</div></div></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:0;font-size:10px;color:#DC2626;font-weight:600;">三者的底和高都相同！</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">
    Parallelogram、Triangle、Trapezoid的底都是 10 cm，高都是 6 cm（Trapezoid上底 4 cm 下底 6 cm）。分別求Area，並比較大小。
  </div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">
    一個Parallelogram和一個Triangle，底相同、高相同。ParallelogramArea是 48 cm²。TriangleArea = ？
    <br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（同底同高時，TriangleArea是Parallelogram的一半）</span>
</div></div>
</div>
<!-- ══ PAGE 3: KP1續 + KP2 ══ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">
    有一個Trapezoid和一個Parallelogram，它們的高相等。Trapezoid上底+下底的和等於Parallelogram的底。ParallelogramArea是 60 cm²。TrapezoidArea = ？
    <br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（上底+下底=底 且 高相等 → TrapezoidArea是Parallelogram的一半）</span>
</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp" style="margin-top:10px;">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：SSPA 常見AreaTrap<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻失分點</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<ol>
<li><strong>單位換算Trap（T5）</strong>：Question給 m 但答案要 cm² → 1 m² = 10,000 cm²（不是 100！）</li>
<li><strong>組合圖形Trap（T4+T5）</strong>：分割後尺寸要從原圖推算，可能給多餘斜邊長度干擾</li>
<li><strong>反求題型Trap（T4）</strong>：給Area求底/高，運算方向容易搞反</li>
<li><strong>÷2遺忘Trap（T5）</strong>：Triangle和Trapezoid公式必須÷2，與Parallelogram混淆</li>
<li><strong>PerimeterArea混淆（T5）</strong>：Question問Area，學生用Perimeter公式作答</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong">
<div class="lf-ex-label">T4 多餘資訊Trap</div>
<div class="eq">Trapezoid：上底5 下底9 高4<br/>斜邊長6 → <span style="color:#DC2626;">多餘！</span></div>
<div style="font-size:10px;margin-top:4px;">斜邊長度不用於Area公式</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex-right">
<div class="lf-ex-label">T5 圖形錯覺Trap</div>
<div class="eq">TriangleArea = 底×高<br/><span style="color:#DC2626;">→ 漏÷2！</span></div>
<div style="font-size:10px;margin-top:4px;">公式必須寫完整：底×高÷2</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="fig-row">
<div class="fig-card">
<div class="fig-title">🪤 Trap對比圖 — 單位換算坑</div>
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 280 130" width="280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#FEF2F2" height="70" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="2.5" width="100" x="20" y="30"></rect><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="55">2 m = 200 cm</text><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="70">Area=?</text><text fill="#991B1B" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="88">有人計2x200=400</text><text fill="#991B1B" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="100">錯！單位不一致</text><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="180" y="55">正確：</text><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="180" y="70">2 m = 200 cm</text><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="180" y="82">200x200</text><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="180" y="94">= 40,000 cm2</text><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="140" y="122">或 2x2 = 4 m2 = 40,000 cm2</text></svg>
</div>
<div class="fig-card">
<div class="fig-title">🪤 組合圖形 — 尺寸推算</div>
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 220 130" width="220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="90" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="70" x="30" y="15"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="65" y="121">70</text><rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="40" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="90" x="100" y="65"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="145" y="121">90</text><line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="1" x1="100" x2="100" y1="15" y2="105"></line></svg>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">
    Trapezoid上底 5 cm，下底 8 cm，斜邊 7 cm，高 4 cm。Area = ？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（Question多給了斜邊7cm—那是T4Trap，不需要用！）</span>
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 5</div><div class="lf-ex-q">
    一個Rectangle長 2 m，闊 150 cm。Area = ？cm²<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（先統一單位：2 m = 200 cm → 200×150）</span>
</div></div>
</div>
<!-- ══ PAGE 4: KP3 + 分層🌱 ══ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Area解題策略 — 四步通關法<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>第一步：判斷形狀</strong> — 正方/長方/Parallelogram/Triangle/Trapezoid/組合形？<br/>
<strong>第二步：選對公式</strong> — 不同形狀不同公式，寫在旁邊再代入<br/>
<strong>第三步：小心代入</strong> — 確認所有單位一致，排除多餘資訊<br/>
<strong>第四步：檢查單位</strong> — Area必須有 ²（cm²、m²），答句完整
    </div>
</div>
<div class="mn">解題Mnemonic：「一判形狀二選式，三代入四查單位。先寫公式再代數，答案必定有 ²。」</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 6</div><div class="lf-ex-q">
    SquarePerimeter 32 cm。Area = ？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（Trap！不能直接用 32 計Area。先求邊長=32÷4=8，再計Area=8×8=64 cm²）</span>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">綜合Trap警報：Question可能混合 T4（多餘資訊）+ T5（圖形錯覺），例如TrapezoidQuestion給斜邊、給Perimeter、又混了單位，必須逐層剝開！</div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>Parallelogram底 10 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>Triangle底 14 cm，高 6 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>Trapezoid上底 6 cm，下底 12 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>Square邊長 9 cm。分別寫出它的<strong>Perimeter</strong>和<strong>Area</strong>。哪個有²？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>Rectangle長 9 cm，闊 5 cm。Area = ？Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ══ PAGE 5: 🌿 + 🌳 ══ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional，共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>
      Trapezoid：上底 5 cm，下底 9 cm，斜邊 8 cm，高 4 cm。Area = ？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（哪個數據不需要？）</span>
</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>TriangleArea 36 cm²，底 9 cm。高 = ？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（反求：高 = Area×2÷底）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>一個Rectangle長 3 m，闊 2 m。Area = ？cm²<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（Trap：單位換算！3m=300cm, 2m=200cm）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>SquarePerimeter 36 cm。它的Area = ？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（不能直接代 36！先求邊長）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>
      L形組合圖形：可分成兩個Rectangle A（10×4 cm）和 B（6×5 cm）。總Area = ？
    </td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional，共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>
<div class="fig-row" style="margin:0;"><div class="fig-card"><svg height="100" viewbox="0 0 180 100" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,70 125,70 155,20 55,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="55" x2="55" y1="20" y2="70"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="67" y="45">h=5</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="90">底=12</text><text fill="#991B1B" font-size="10" font-weight="700" x="140" y="55">斜邊=8</text><text fill="#991B1B" font-size="10" x="148" y="65">(不是高!)</text></svg></div></div>Parallelogram底 12 cm，相鄰斜邊 8 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？Perimeter = ？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（Area用底×高；Perimeter用(底+斜邊)×2—注意兩者用不同邊！）</span>
</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>
      Trapezoid上底 6 cm，下底 10 cm，高 5 cm。一個Parallelogram的底等於Trapezoid上底+下底，高與Trapezoid相同。ParallelogramArea是TrapezoidArea的幾倍？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（Parallelogram=16×5=80, Trapezoid=(6+10)×5÷2=40 → 2倍）</span>
</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>
      Triangle底 8 cm，高 6 cm。若底不變、高增加 2 cm，新Area比原Area多多少？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（原=24, 新=8×8÷2=32, 多8 cm²）</span>
</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>
      TrapezoidArea 72 cm²，高 8 cm。上底是下底的 1/2。上底和下底各是多少？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（上底+下底=72×2÷8=18, 設下底=x 上底=0.5x → 1.5x=18）</span>
</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>
      一個Parallelogram用 28 cm 鐵線圍成（每邊長度均為整數 cm，鄰邊不相等）。Area最大可能是多少？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（Perimeter=28→底+斜邊=14，Area=底×高，需考慮不同底高的組合）</span>
</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ══ PAGE 6: Word Problems ══ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、AreaWord Problems — SSPA 綜合Trap訓練（共 8 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>Triangle花圃底 12 m，高 8 m。Area = ？m²</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>Trapezoid田地上底 15 m，下底 25 m，高 10 m。Area = ？m²</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>一幅Parallelogram牆壁底 6 m，相鄰邊 5 m，高 4 m。要髹油漆，每 m² 用 0.25 L。共需多少升？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（5m是斜邊—多餘資訊！Area=6×4=24 m²）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>Square花圃Perimeter 48 m。每 m² 種 5 棵花，共可種多少棵？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（先求邊長=48÷4=12, Area=144 m²）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>一個 L 形公園分成：Rectangle A（20 m × 15 m）和Rectangle B（12 m × 8 m）。公園總Area = ？m²</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>Trapezoid停車場上底 30 m，下底 50 m，高 20 m。每輛車佔地 25 m²，最多可停多少輛？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>一個Triangle和一個Parallelogram底相同、高相同。TriangleArea 25 m²。ParallelogramArea = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td><div class="fig-row" style="margin:0;"><div class="fig-card"><svg height="120" viewbox="0 0 180 120" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DCFCE7" points="30,55 150,55 90,35" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="32">h=1.5m</text><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="40" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="120" x="30" y="55"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="113">底=2m</text></svg></div></div>一幅組合壁畫：Triangle部分（底 2 m 高 1.5 m）下方接Rectangle（2 m × 3 m）。總Area = ？m²</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、🏔️ 終極挑戰專區（共 3 題，🚀 Optional，呈分試壓軸＋競賽級別）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️1</td><td>
<div class="fig-row" style="margin:0;"><div class="fig-card"><svg height="96" viewbox="0 0 150 120" width="120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,70 115,70 95,20 55,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="55" x2="55" y1="20" y2="70"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="67" y="45">h=8</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="75" y="90">b₂</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="75" y="12">b₁</text></svg></div></div>TrapezoidArea 144 cm²，高 8 cm。上底是下底的 3 倍。上底和下底各是多少？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（上底+下底=144×2÷8=36, 設下底=x 上底=3x → 4x=36 → x=9, 上=27）</span>
</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️2</td><td>
      一個多邊形可分成：Triangle（底 8 cm 高 5 cm）+ Rectangle（8 cm × 6 cm）+ Trapezoid（上底 4 cm 下底 8 cm 高 3 cm）。總Area = ？<br/>
<svg height="120" style="display:block;margin:4px 0;" viewbox="0 0 240 120" width="240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="30">分成三部分計算：</text><text fill="#D97706" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="50">Triangle A = 底x高/2</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="70">Rectangle B = 長x闊</text><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="90">Trapezoid C = (a+b)xh/2</text><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="112">總Area = A + B + C</text></svg>
</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️3</td><td>
      Square邊長增加 3 cm 後，新Square比原SquareArea多 57 cm²。原Square的邊長 = ？<br/>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（設原邊長=x → (x+3)²−x²=57 → x²+6x+9−x²=57 → 6x=48 → x=8）</span>
</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ══ PAGE 7: 功課 + Common Error ══ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Homework</div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>Parallelogram底 11 cm，高 6 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>Triangle底 16 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>Trapezoid上底 7 cm，下底 15 cm，高 6 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>SquarePerimeter 28 cm。Area = ？<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（不能直接代28！先求邊長=28÷4=7）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>Rectangle長 4 m，闊 250 cm。Area = ？m²<br/><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);">（250 cm = 2.5 m）</span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)（共 3 題，🚀 Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>TrapezoidArea 84 cm²，高 7 cm，下底是上底的 2 倍。上底和下底各是多少？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>一個Triangle和一個Parallelogram等高。Triangle底 10 cm，Parallelogram底 5 cm。TriangleArea是Parallelogram的幾倍？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>一個Rectangle，長是闊的 2 倍。若Perimeter是 36 cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">七、Common Error Summary</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>三角/Trapezoid忘記÷2</strong>（T5圖形錯覺）</td><td>Triangle=底×高<span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:900;">÷2</span>；Trapezoid=(上底+下底)×高<span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:900;">÷2</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Perimeter公式當Area用</strong>（T5混淆）</td><td>Area是「乘積」，Perimeter是「加總」，兩者完全不同</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>高用錯斜邊</strong>（T5圖形錯覺）</td><td>高＝底邊的<span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:900;">垂直距離</span>，不是傾斜的邊長</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>單位換算錯誤</strong>（T5）</td><td>1 m² = <span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:900;">10,000</span> cm²（不是 100！因為 100×100）</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>給Perimeter求Area時直接代入</strong>（T4多餘資訊）</td><td>先從Perimeter求邊長/底高 → 再求Area（必須分兩步！）</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>反求時運算方向倒置</strong>（T4）</td><td>Area×2÷底=高（三角）；Area×2÷(上底+下底)=高（Trapezoid）</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Area單位漏寫²</strong></td><td>Area答案必須寫 cm² / m²，呈分試漏²必定扣分！</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="end-note">LF Academy · LF Academy · We don't teach math — we teach trap avoidance.。 · LF-P5-上-L05</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:4px;text-align:center;">📚 Related Topics：L03 Parallelogram與TriangleArea · L04 Trapezoid多邊形Area · L05 AreaTrap專項</div>
